I wake up.
I look out of the window.
The sky is completely black.
It is still very dark outside.
I hear the wind.
It is very windy.
My mobile is on the bedside table.
I pick up the mobile.
I open the weather app.
The forecast is not good.
Today it will rain.
And it will be very cold.
The weather is really uninviting.
I sigh.
My bed is so beautifully warm.
I close my eyes.
I stay in bed for five more minutes.
